From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] radv/ps5: radv submit thread

Port PlayTendoh 0008 (source reference commit 80a816a05c).
RADV_PS5_SUBMIT_THREAD=1 opts in; otherwise submit synchronously.
Keep FIFO sequencing, ring retirement and our submission dump metadata.
Drain before clock packets and AGC state changes. Propagate async failure
through CPU waits. Serialize platform totals at their ten-second snapshot
because platform.c is absent from the supplied inputs. Preserve the
lead-mesh-12 print-after-unlock fix, absent from the supplied cs snapshot.
The worker and queue live until process exit; no driver unload support.

Credit: PlayTendoh patches/mesa; source reference 80a816a05c in
playtendoh-prosperoeden-2026-11-07.md. The supplied mail patches carry
zero commit IDs; individual upstream commit IDs were not supplied.
---
